      "writtenOn": "2022-03-18T08:23:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In Android, we follow the header orderings:\n```\n\u003cC\u003e\n\n\u003cC++\u003e\n\n\u003cANDROID\u003e\n\n\u003cproject\u003e\n```",
